      "assets": [],
      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/tarball/1.110",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode/zipball/1.110",
      "body": "Welcome to the February 2026 release of Visual Studio Code. This release makes agents practical for longer-running and more complex tasks, giving you more control and visibility, new ways to extend agents, and smarter session management.\r\n\r\n[Agent plugins](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_agent-plugins-experimental): install prepackaged bundles of skills, tools, and hooks from the Extensions view\r\n\r\n[Agentic browser tools](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_agentic-browser-tools-experimental): let the agent drive the browser to interact with your app and verify its own changes\r\n\r\n[Session memory](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_session-memory-for-plans): persist plans and guidance across conversation turns\r\n\r\n[Context compaction](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_context-compaction): manually compact conversation history to free up context space\r\n\r\n[Fork a chat session](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_fork-a-chat-session): create a new, independent session that inherits conversation history to explore alternative approaches\r\n\r\n[Agent Debug panel](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_agent-debug-panel-preview): get real-time visibility into agent events, tool calls, and loaded customizations\r\n\r\n[Chat accessibility](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_accessibility): use chat to its fullest with screen reader improvements, keyboard navigation, and notification signals\r\n\r\n[Create agent customizations from chat](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_create-agent-customizations-from-chat): generate prompts, skills, agents, and hooks directly from a conversation\r\n\r\n[Kitty graphics protocol](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110#_terminal): render high-fidelity images directly in the integrated terminal\r\n\r\nFor the complete release notes go to [Updates](https://code.visualstudio.com/updates/v1_110) on [code.visualstudio.com](https://code.visualstudio.com/).\r\n\r\nInsiders: Want to see new features as soon as possible? You can download the nightly [Insiders](https://code.visualstudio.com/insiders) build and try the latest updates as soon as they are available. And for the latest Visual Studio Code news, updates, and content, follow us on Twitter [@code](https://twitter.com/code)!\r\n\r\nHappy Coding!",
